## External Reference

"Zendesk #88123 (open)": the system (an embedded Integration Reference), the id as the other system writes it, and its status word VERBATIM — mapping foreign vocabularies onto local enums is where sync lies begin. `lastSeenAt` says how fresh.

```ts
import { ExternalReferenceField } from '@cardstack/catalog/fields/external-reference/external-reference-field';

@field externalRef = contains(ExternalReferenceField);
```

### Non-goals

No live sync (the platform has no outbound integration runtime); this is the honest record of a reference, not a connection.
